# NASA api.nasa.gov API key (free signup: https://api.nasa.gov/signup).
# Sent along with NASA DONKI space-weather requests (apps/web/lib/
# nasaDataService.ts) and available to any api.nasa.gov call.
#
# OPTIONAL: NASA moved DONKI to the keyless CCMC API on 2026-09-30, so the app
# works without a key today. The key rides along on every DONKI request and
# future-proofs the app if NASA re-gates the API, and raises rate limits on
# api.nasa.gov endpoints.
#
# Real values belong in .env.local (gitignored) — never commit them.
# NOTE: this app is a static export (`output: "export"`), so
# NEXT_PUBLIC_NASA_API_KEY is embedded in the public JS bundle by design
# (PRD SEC-5 allows "NEXT_PUBLIC_* non-sensitive config"). NASA keys are free,
# rate-limited and revocable — rotate yours at api.nasa.gov if abused.
NASA_API_KEY=
NEXT_PUBLIC_NASA_API_KEY=

# NVIDIA NIM API Key for DeepSeek-v4.1-flash Autonomous Lunar Sortie Synthesis
# Get a free key at https://build.nvidia.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4.1-flash
NVIDIA_API_KEY=
